              "name": "1010lisalynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Hello Summer Freshness! The vibrant colors and flavors of this salad sing summer!! The garden freshness of the tomatoes with the sweetness of the watermelon, the spiciness of the arugula and red onions play perfectly together in the bowl. The final touch is with the salty binders of feta cheese and vinegarette!!! The addition of 1 teaspoon of honey made this salad a 5+. Bring on the sunshine.",
