              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "whistletoes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This did the trick for watermelon feta salad. There are a lot to choose from. Did not have arugula so I just used Romain. Added a little fresh mint. Rinsed the onions, but not sure if that was necessary. I just didn’t want over powering onion flavor.",
