            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MamaLisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added cucumbers, mint, and toasted almonds and held the onion. Made the dressing with white jalapeno lime balsamic vinegar from Olive and Grape. Go light on the olive oil as it's not needed. My guests loved the final salad!",
            "datePublished": "2015-09-06T18:01:38.240Z"
          },
