            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MaryLou"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad is so refreshing, perfect for the warm weather! It has saltiness from the feta and sweetness from the watermelon. Such a great combination of flavors. I couldn't find white balsamic vinegar, so I used regular. I also had a big thing of spinach to use, so I doubled the spinach and left out the arugula. We'll be making this a lot this summer.",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-31T02:30:15.343Z"
